      "created_at": "2022-06-13T19:05:31.528Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Can you believe it’s been <strong>three</strong> years since the last Sidekick update? With all that’s been happening in the world of Sentinels, we decided it was time to kick the tires and freshen it up.</p>\n<p>Introducing Sentinels Sidekick <strong>3.0</strong> - <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/sentinels-sidekick/id525436193\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">now available on the App Store!</a> It supports all <strong>three</strong> of the Sentinels core games:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sentinels of the Multiverse: <strong>Definitive Edition</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Sentinels of <strong>Earth-Prime</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Sentinels of the Multiverse <strong>(Enhanced Edition)</strong>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>High resolution official artwork and nemesis icons for both new core games are <strong>included</strong> at no additional cost.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.handelabra.com/blog/2022/6/8/sentinels-sidekick-turns-three\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Read more about it on our blog!</a></p>",
      "post_number": 1,
